                                "example_id": "ae8a01e3-d34c-4040-a3b1-053665efb12b",
                                "sense_id": "17f2ad68-062c-3209-9aa5-7968b4c1e1ee",
                                "text": "3 quindecillion, 657 quattuordecillion, 262 tredecillion; which is to say the figures 3,657,262 followed by 42 ciphers. Operators of the key punch machines transfer a code symbol from the Census …."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd4f3864-fb61-46bd-bb4f-29da5ea7f311",
                                "sense_id": "17f2ad68-062c-3209-9aa5-7968b4c1e1ee",
                                "text": "One supernova, in 1054, was thought by many to herald the biblical Day of Judgment. We have reached an energy level of 10 quindecillion ergs, or 10⁴⁹ ergs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
